# Feature Planning With Code Map

Canonical rules: `AGENTS.md` in this repo plus `plan-product:using-code-map`.

When planning: use the task or feature guide first, then one minimum module doc from `docs/code-map/modules/<module>.md`. Regenerate with `npm run map-code`. Start at `docs/code-map/index.md`.
